## 1. Project Overview

This project focuses on developing an automated computer vision pipeline for identifying Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) in industrial, manufacturing, and construction environments. By leveraging the advanced YOLO-NAS architecture, the system is designed to detect essential safety gear to assist in automated safety compliance monitoring and risk mitigation.

